          <fr:mainmatter>
            <html:p>
    There exists an ordered field <fr:tex display="inline">\mathbb {R}</fr:tex> that satisfies the <fr:link href="/def-0012/" title="Least upper bound property" uri="https://caimeo.space/def-0012/" display-uri="def-0012" type="local">least upper bound property</fr:link>.
    Moreover <fr:tex display="inline">\mathbb {R}</fr:tex> contains <fr:tex display="inline">\mathbb {Q}</fr:tex> as a subfield.
</html:p>
